# Shared OverKartLibrary

`src/OverKartLibrary/` is one Library. AmpedUpDecomp, OverKartDecomp, and
LibraryDecomp must keep that directory identical.

Do not fork, specialize, or host-patch files under `src/OverKartLibrary/`.
If a host needs different behavior, put it outside that directory
(`src/AmpedUp/`, `src/OverKart5/`, vanilla hooks, or other host-owned files).

`OverKartDefaults.h` stays in Library (identical `*Default` prototypes).
`OverKartDefaults.c` is stepped out of this directory. Bodies live in
`src/AmpedUp/OverKartDefaults.c`, `src/OverKart5/OverKartDefaults.c`, or
LibraryDecomp `src/OverKartDefaults.c`.

A Library bugfix or contract change is made the same way in all three copies
in the same effort, or not at all. Do not "fix it only in this host."
